    "implementation_guidance": "Enhanced guidance with CFIR framework: 1. Assess organizational readiness by evaluating structural characteristics, relational connections, and culture. 2. Evaluate existing infrastructure to ensure it supports the protocol. 3. Identify key stakeholders and champions to drive implementation. 4. Develop a detailed implementation plan with clear goals and timelines. 5. Engage and train clinical pharmacists and other staff. 6. Execute the protocol with fidelity. 7. Reflect on and evaluate the implementation process and outcomes. 8. Adapt the protocol as needed to fit the local context. 9. Plan for sustainability.",
    "expected_outcomes": "Enhanced outcomes with specific metrics and confidence intervals: Reduced 30-day all-cause readmission rate (e.g., 15% [95% CI: 13-17%]), reduced 30-day HF-specific readmission rate (e.g., 8% [95% CI: 6-10%]), reduced all-cause mortality rate (e.g., 30-day mortality: 2% [95% CI: 1-3%]), decreased emergency department (ED) visit rate (e.g., 30-day ED visit rate: 10 per 100 patient-days [95% CI: 8-12]), and improved medication adherence rate (e.g., 70% [95% CI: 65-75%]).",
