    "conclusion": "This protocol provides a comprehensive, evidence-based approach to assessing neighborhood safety as a social determinant of health, with a focus on effective implementation through the CFIR framework, cultural adaptation for health equity, and robust measurement. By systematically addressing neighborhood safety, we can contribute to improved health outcomes and reduced disparities, particularly within Medicaid populations.",
