        "citation": "Seligman, H. K., Lyles, C., Marshall, M. B., Prendergast, K., Smith, M. C., Headings, A., Bradshaw, G., Rosenmoss, S., & Waxman, E. (2015). A Pilot Food Bank Intervention Featuring Diabetes-Appropriate Food Improved Glycemic Control Among Clients In Three States. *Health Affairs (Project Hope)*, 34(11), 1956\u20131963.",
        "url": "https://doi.org/10.1377/hlthaff.2015.0641"
