          "Myocardial Infarction (MI): Reduced by 11% (Peto OR, 0.89 [95% CI, 0.82 to 0.96]). (k=11, N=134,470 trials)",
          "Ischemic stroke: Reduced by 18% (Peto OR, 0.82 [95% CI, 0.72 to 0.92]). (k=5, N=79,334 trials)",
