          "Colorectal Cancer (CRC) incidence: No statistically significant association during trial periods, but post-trial observation up to 20 years showed significant reductions (0.70 [95% CI, 0.50 to 0.98] and 0.82 [95% CI, 0.69 to 0.98]).",
