                "text": "Tailored messaging and educational interventions are crucial. Studies show that adults with lower incomes have significantly decreased odds of receiving the influenza vaccine (e.g., aOR = 0.79; 95% CI, 0.75-0.83 for those with family income <$35,000 compared to \u2265$100,000) [2]. Strategies should:"
