    "implementation_guidance": "This protocol leverages the Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research (CFIR) to guide its implementation. Key steps include: 1) Clearly defining the protocol (Innovation) based on evidence from sources like the Bone Health & Osteoporosis Foundation and CDC STEADI. 2) Addressing the Outer Setting by aligning with Medicaid policies and forging partnerships with local health systems. 3) Strengthening the Inner Setting by utilizing existing infrastructure and fostering a culture of patient-centered care. 4) Engaging Individuals through comprehensive training and building self-efficacy among community health teams. 5) Managing the Process through careful planning, stakeholder engagement, systematic execution, and continuous reflection and evaluation.",
