          "**Innovation Source:** The credibility and reputability of the developers and sponsors of the protocol.",
          "**Innovation Evidence-Base:** The robust evidence supporting the effectiveness of CBT and culturally adapted CBT.",
          "**Innovation Relative Advantage:** The extent to which the protocol is perceived as better than existing referral practices.",
          "**Innovation Adaptability:** The ability to modify or tailor the protocol to fit local contexts and specific Medicaid populations.",
          "**Innovation Trialability:** The feasibility of piloting the protocol on a small scale.",
          "**Innovation Complexity:** The perceived difficulty and scope of implementing the protocol.",
          "**Innovation Design:** The clarity, organization, and presentation of the protocol.",
          "**Innovation Cost:** The affordability of implementing and operating the protocol."
