          "**Local Conditions:** Economic, environmental, political, and technological factors in the external environment.",
          "**Partnerships & Connections:** The strength of networks with external entities, including referral partners and community organizations.",
          "**Policies & Laws:** Relevant legislation, regulations, and guidelines that support the protocol.",
          "**Financing:** Availability of external funding (e.g., grants, Medicaid reimbursement) for implementation.",
