          "**Assessing Context:** Identifying barriers and facilitators to implementation.",
          "**Planning:** Outlining specific steps, milestones, goals, and measures for implementation success.",
          "**Tailoring Strategies:** Choosing and operationalizing implementation strategies to fit the context.",
          "**Engaging:** Attracting and encouraging participation from deliverers and recipients.",
          "**Doing:** Implementing the protocol in small steps or cycles of change.",
          "**Reflecting & Evaluating:** Collecting and discussing information about the success of both implementation and the innovation itself.",
